# Immediate Handover

When infra/ops/agent workflow changes: update `AGENTS.md` same task before close. §11 alone insufficient.

| Trigger | Where |
|---------|--------|
| Git/release scripts, F5 path, build policy, new `scripts/`, new §8 patterns | `AGENTS.md` relevant § + optional alwaysApply `.mdc` |
| User work style / UI taste / aesthetic / collaboration preference (stated or implied) | `AGENTS.md` §9.5 — append dated bullet same task; no separate file |

Do not create `HANDOVER.md`. `AGENTS.md` is sole dev doc (`README.md` user landing exception only).
